<title>FRANCE: Parcel bomb in Paris injures one.</title>
<headline>Parcel bomb in Paris injures one.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A parcel bomb exploded in the storeroom of a home decoration shop in Paris on Thursday, injuring one person, rescue workers said.</p>
<p>The person's life was not in danger, they said. The was no immediate claim of responsibility for the blast, in the Rue Monge in Paris' Latin Quarter.</p>
